sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Realtime as Realtime Gateway (WebSocket)
    actor RecipientDevice as Recipient Device

    API->>Realtime: Push server.message.delivery event
    Realtime->>RecipientDevice: WSS server.message.delivery (EnvelopeID, OpaquePayload)
    RecipientDevice->>API: POST /api/v1/envelopes/:id/delivered
    API-->>RecipientDevice: 200 OK (Status: Delivered)
